  Description: "COMPANION / PRISMATIC / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nOn purchase, recruit up
    to 4 friendly marbles, within the 15-body limit.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nChampion
    / Healing per second: +0.04\nChampion / Movement speed: -0.3%\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nA caller whose voice gathers residents from the marble valleys. They once
    rang people back into a locked refuge. Every call now ends with silence long
    enough for someone to choose not to answer.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional
    periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories;
    their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated.
    Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nSource: dream shop or
    special reward, subject to hero theme and unlock wave.\r\nBonds: clock, resolve.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
